<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6778224546"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:33.670"><div begin="8.285" end="40.473" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="8.285" end="13.694" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.285" end="9.434">不要问我</span><span begin="9.434" end="10.421">从哪里</span><span begin="10.421" end="13.694">来</span></p><p begin="14.989" end="19.474" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.989" end="17.266">我的故乡在远</span><span begin="17.266" end="19.474">方</span></p><p begin="21.875" end="27.989" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.875" end="23.978">为什麼流</span><span begin="23.978" end="27.989">浪</span></p><p begin="29.620" end="40.473" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.620" end="30.963">流浪远</span><span begin="30.963" end="36.120">方</span> <span begin="36.951" end="37.864">流</span><span begin="37.864" end="40.473">浪</span></p></div><div begin="42.536" end="1:21.030" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="42.536" end="48.433" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.536" end="45.112">为了天空飞翔的小</span><span begin="45.112" end="48.433">鸟</span></p><p begin="49.347" end="54.417" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.347" end="51.866">为了山间轻流的小</span><span begin="51.866" end="54.417">溪</span></p><p begin="56.170" end="1:02.540" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.170" end="57.510">为了</span><span begin="57.510" end="58.714">宽阔的草</span><span begin="58.714" end="1:02.540">原</span></p><p begin="1:04.009" end="1:15.713" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.009" end="1:05.352">流浪远</span><span begin="1:05.352" end="1:10.509">方</span> <span begin="1:11.340" end="1:12.253">流</span><span begin="1:12.253" end="1:15.713">浪</span></p><p begin="1:18.134" end="1:21.030" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.134" end="1:18.993">流</span><span begin="1:18.993" end="1:21.030">浪</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.211" end="1:54.746" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:26.211" end="1:29.350" itunes:key="L10"